## 客户端同步流程

```
启动
  │
  ├─ GET /api/catalog/artists     ──→ 写入 artists 表
  ├─ GET /api/catalog/songs       ──→ 写入 songs 表 + 重建 FTS5 索引
  ├─ GET /api/catalog/categories  ──→ 写入 categories 表
  └─ GET /api/catalog/rankings    ──→ 写入 rankings 表
                                          │
  用户浏览 / 搜索                          │
    SELECT * FROM songs WHERE ...   ←─────┘  (纯本地)
    SELECT * FROM songs_fts WHERE ... MATCH '...'
                                          │
  用户查看歌手详情                          │
    SELECT * FROM artists WHERE id = ?     │
    SELECT * FROM songs WHERE id IN (      │
      SELECT id FROM songs WHERE json_extract(artistRefs, ...)  │
    )                                      │
                                          │
  用户点歌                                  │
    GET /media/songs/{id}/video.xxx  ──→ PlaybackAssetCache
    GET /media/songs/{id}/vocal.xxx  ──→ PlaybackAssetCache
    GET /media/songs/{id}/inst.xxx   ──→ PlaybackAssetCache
    GET /media/songs/{id}/cover.xxx  ──→ PlaybackAssetCache
    GET /media/songs/{id}/lyrics.krl ──→ PlaybackAssetCache
                                          │
  切歌 / App 退出 / 缓存压力               │
    PlaybackAssetCache 全部清空 ◄──────────┘
```

